        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Founded in 1995 and headquartered in Oslo, Norway, we have transitioned from browser developer to multi-faceted platform offering a range of products and services that include PC and mobile browsers, our Opera Gaming portals and development tools, Opera News content platforms, Opera Ads platform, as well as a number of AI and web3 products and services, such as MiniPay and Opera AI, to a global",
